  "question": "Over 2011 to 2013, how closely did F-12's monthly water cut follow its choke opening? Give the correlation and what it suggests."
 },
 "to_review": false,
 "note": "Oct 28 night (seventh panel): verdict changed on purpose by the new rules (a conclusion drawn with ', so' in a fact).",
 "expected": {
  "accepted": false,
